{"id":44297,"date":"2025-09-06T12:09:47","date_gmt":"2025-09-06T11:09:47","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=44297"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:46:37","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:46:37","slug":"trail-vitoriano-2024-2","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-vitoriano-2024-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Vitoriano 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O 9\u00ba TRAIL VITORIANO de Ermidas Sado \u00e9 um evento de natureza desportiva, organizado pela sec\u00e7\u00e3o de atletismo do Vit\u00f3ria Futebol Clube Ermidense (VFCE), com os apoios da C\u00e2mara Municipal de Santiago do Cac\u00e9m, Junta de Freguesia de Ermidas Sado, C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gr\u00e2ndola, Junta de Freguesia de Azinheira dos Barros, Guarda Nacional Republicana, Cruz Vermelha Portuguesa \u2013 delega\u00e7\u00e3o de Ermidas Sado e Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria de Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Alvalade, entre outros.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O evento \u00e9 composto por dois percursos a decorrer em simult\u00e2neo, Trail longo de 21km e Trail curto de 13km de car\u00e1ter competitivo e a caminhada de 13km de car\u00e1ter n\u00e3o competitivo.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":44316,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497],"event_type_2":[728,48],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-44297","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-ermidas-sado-setubal","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-setubal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/68b9bd154ef22_cart